xt":"What should ration optimization do with the available ingredients and nutrition requirements? → assumed: Compare candidate mixes and identify the lowest-cost mix that meets user-selected nutrition requirements; let the user choose whether to save it."},{"fromDefault":"roles","fromQuestion":"Q9","fromSpan":["I-4"],"id":"ASM-6","risk":"high","text":"Who may create, revise, optimize, or approve ration definitions? → assumed: Two roles: an administrator and a standard user."},{"fromQuestion":"Q10","fromSpan":["I-5"],"id":"ASM-7","risk":"high","text":"What should happen to a saved feed plan if its pen count, ration, or bunk-rate inputs change after generation? → assumed: Keep the saved plan unchanged, flag it for review, and require an authorized user to confirm or regenerate it."},{"fromDefault":"roles","fromQuestion":"Q11","fromSpan":["I-5"],"id":"ASM-8","risk":"high","text":"Who may create or adjust feed plans, and who may update execution status? → assumed: Two roles: an administrator and a standard user."},{"fromQuestion":"Q12","fromSpan":["I-6"],"id":"ASM-9","risk":"high","text":"What should happen when a feeding event would consume more ingredient stock than is available? → assumed: Block saving the event until stock is sufficient or an authorized inventory adjustment is recorded."},{"fromDefault":"audit","fromQuestion":"Q13","fromSpan":["I-6"],"id":"ASM-10","risk":"high","text":"How should a saved feeding event be corrected or voided? → assumed: Who created and last changed each record, and when; no full audit trail."},{"fromDefault":"roles","fromQuestion":"Q14","fromSpan":["I-6"],"id":"ASM-11","risk":"high","text":"Who may record feeding activity and who may correct or void saved activity? → assumed: Two roles: an administrator and a standard user."},{"fromDefault":"roles","fromQuestion":"Q15","fromSpan":["I-7"],"id":"ASM-12","risk":"high","text":"Who may add lot weight measurements? → assumed: Two roles: an administrator and a standard user."},{"fromQuesti