y and updates it when underlying records change, without specifying access scope or data-availability qualification."},{"behaviour":2,"sketch":2,"summary":"Recomputes from active-lot data and indicates no active lots or uncalculable metrics."},{"behaviour":1,"sketch":3,"summary":"Shows contributing period and data availability, and limits the yard summary to users with yard access."}],"span":"I-11","topic":"Yard-summary access and data qualification"},{"id":"D-21","readings":[{"behaviour":0,"sketch":1,"summary":"Calls for a usable web-app demo, prompt overview, validation results, challenges, readiness assessment, and mock-data limitations."},{"behaviour":1,"sketch":2,"summary":"Requires a demonstrable responsive web app with representative sample data and a walkthrough of observable results."},{"behaviour":1,"sketch":3,"summary":"Requires a working responsive demo demonstrating procurement through feeding and performance reporting, plus explicit limits when a workflow cannot be demonstrated."}],"span":"I-12","topic":"Demo and presentation deliverables"}],"round":1}